        "# Random Variable Bivariat\n",
        "\n",
        "## Pengertian\n",
        "\n",
        "Random variable bivariat melibatkan dua variabel acak yang diamati bersama, misalnya tinggi dan berat, permintaan dan biaya, atau storage dan compute dalam komputasi awan.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Membuat Data Bivariat dengan Korelasi\n",
        "\n",
        "### `np.random.multivariate_normal(mean, cov, size)`\n",
        "\n",
        "Contoh dua variabel dengan korelasi positif."
      ],
      "id": "4666edaf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "mean = [170, 65]\n",
        "cov = [[8**2, 0.7*8*10],\n",
        "       [0.7*8*10, 10**2]]\n",
        "\n",
        "bivariat = np.random.multivariate_normal(mean, cov, size=1000)\n",
        "\n",
        "x = bivariat[:, 0]\n",
        "y = bivariat[:, 1]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(x[:5])\n",
        "print(y[:5])"
      ],
      "id": "02543409",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Menyusun Data Bivariat dalam `pandas`"
      ],
      "id": "c28dd6c5"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "df_biv = pd.DataFrame({\n",
        "    \"tinggi\": x,\n",
        "    \"berat\": y\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "df_biv.head()"
      ],
      "id": "aa65c5be",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
